{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1120422001:0":{"text":"땅에 편지를 묻을 때 뭔가 가뿐한 느낌을 받았어. 마치 작별하기라도 한 것처럼…","source_cn":"信埋进土里的瞬间，我感到了放松很多，像是完成了告别……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0BF92E9F86E29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120422002:0":{"text":"잭슨이 왜 나를 그렇게 부러워했는지 알 것 같아.","source_cn":"我想起来了，贾克松大哥之前为什么会说很羡慕我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A11724B67E6FB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120422003:0":{"text":"왜?","source_cn":"为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E7417DCB53E6D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120422004:0":{"text":"모래 폭풍을 피하려고 암벽 뒤에 움츠리고 있을 때, 잭슨이 나한테 이제 죽는 거냐고 묻더라.","source_cn":"当时我们蜷缩在岩壁后面躲避沙暴，他问我，我们是不是要死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EFCEE4D920070A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120422005:0":{"text":"그래서 내가 “아니요, 절대! 내가 죽으면 멜리사가 슬퍼할 거니까요!”라고 했거든.","source_cn":"我说：不！要是我死了，梅丽莎一定会哭出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F65CE4EBFC18FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120422006:0":{"text":"그러니 잭슨이 “눈물이라… 행복하군.”이라고 하면서…","source_cn":"他说，能流泪，很幸福。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA4507105B1C69D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120422007:0":{"text":"“죽은 후 누군가가 날 위해 울어준다는 건 참 행복한 일일 것 같군…” 이런 말을 하더라.","source_cn":"有死后能为自己流泪的人，是更值得庆幸的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E49041464D2B6C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120422008:0":{"text":"잭슨 씨…","source_cn":"贾克松大哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA3A8FC992581CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1120422008":{"text":"잭슨 씨…","source_cn":"贾克松大哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA3A8FC992581CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120422009:0":{"text":"제… 제가 어찌 울겠어요? 저희는 상록수 학회의 트윈 스타라고요! 앞으로 산과 사막을 건너 금기된 신의 지식까지 탐구하는 사람인데… 어찌…","source_cn":"我……我怎么能哭？！我们，冬青学会的双星！跨越了群山和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66A03B8F37084107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120422010:0":{"text":"길에서 처음 만난 사람을 위해 눈물을…","source_cn":"怎么能为一个在路上随随便便碰到的，连朋友都算不上的人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3052DC6A29ADE9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120422011:0":{"text":"윽… 흐흑…","source_cn":"呜……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA20BFE0AD56F63EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120422012:0":{"text":"고마워요, 잭슨 씨. 정말 고마워요…","source_cn":"谢谢你，贾克松大哥，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE97ECD4243EB3550","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120422013:0":{"text":"괜찮아, 갈리. 시원하게 울어. 잭슨 씨가 편하게 쉴 수 있도록 눈물을 흘려주자.","source_cn":"没关系的，伽利，痛快地哭吧，用我们的泪水，让贾克松大哥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF81E8C9375FFEA2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"울고 싶으면 울어","source_cn":"想哭就哭吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6FE0BEE28AB39589","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"울고 싶으면 울어","female":"울고 싶으면 울어","variant_male_record_index":"64670","variant_female_record_index":"64671","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"눈물을 흘릴 수 있다는 건 행복한 일이야","source_cn":"能流泪是很幸福的事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB725B02E5557